# ── Unreal Engine ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated by the engine on demand. Never commit these.
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/

# Plugin build output (plugins themselves are versioned, their output is not)
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# ── IDE / build tooling ─────────────────────────────
# El IDE es Rider y el proyecto se abre por `Project_C.uproject`. El modelo lo genera
# UBT solo, dentro de `Intermediate/`, que ya esta ignorado mas arriba. No hay .sln
# que generar ni project files que regenerar al agregar un .cpp.
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
# Restos de CMake, de cuando el IDE era CLion. Ya no se generan, pero quedan ignorados
# porque un `-CMakefile` a mano los vuelve a dejar: `cmake-build-*` llegó a pesar 63 GB.
/CMakeLists.txt
/CMakeSettings.json
/compile_commands.json
/cmake-build-*/
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# ── OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ── Arcane / Claude Code ────────────────────────────────────────
# Slide decks shipped with the Arcane docs — binaries unrelated to the game.
.claude/docs/presentations/*.pptx
# Append-only session log; noise in diffs. active.md IS versioned.
production/session-state/*.log

# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API keys and local-only config. This repo is public — never commit these.
.env
.env.local

# ── Explicitly versioned ────────────────────────────────────────
# Listed for the next person reading this file, not because git needs it:
#   *.uproject, Config/, Content/, Source/, Plugins/*/Source/, docs/
